+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>All Crop CN · Accounts</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/account.css"><script src="/account.js" defer></script></head><body><aside class="rail"><div class="brand">◈ <span>All Crop CN<small>PC WEB WORKSPACE</small></span></div><div class="rail-title">Your work.<br>Your workspace.</div><p>Independent accounts. Controlled access. The same trusted calculation rules.</p><div class="phase">ACCOUNT HIERARCHY · PC EDITION</div><small>Superadmin · Admin · Independent users.</small></aside><main><p><a href="/portal">← Choose application</a> · <a href="/portal/manage">Company & module management</a></p><header><span>Account centre</span><b id="identity">Sign in</b></header><div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><section id="login-section" class="card narrow"><span class="eyebrow">WELCOME</span><h1>Sign in to your workspace</h1><p>Use the account created by your administrator.</p><p>Forgot password? Users contact their own admin or superadmin. Admins contact superadmin. Superadmin uses the protected operator recovery tool.</p><form id="login-form"><label>Username<input name="username" autocomplete="username" required maxlength="80"></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="128"></label><button type="submit">Sign in →</button></form></section><section id="signed-in" hidden><div class="heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">PRIVATE WORKSPACE</span><h1 id="welcome">Account overview</h1></div><button id="logout" class="secondary">Sign out</button></div><div class="card" id="workspace-card"><h2>Workspace status</h2><p id="workspace-status">Loading…</p><p class="muted"><a href="/workspace">Open projects & workbooks →</a> · Storage limits enforced server-side.</p></div><div class="card"><h2 id="password-title">Change password</h2><p id="password-note">Changing your password signs out every session. Sign in again afterwards.</p><form id="password-form" class="inline-form"><label>Current password<input type="password" name="current_password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="128"></label><label>New password<input type="password" name="new_password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" required></label><button type="submit">Change password</button></form><button id="logout-all" class="secondary">Sign out all sessions</button></div><section id="admin-panel" hidden><div class="heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">ADMINISTRATOR</span><h2>Users & access</h2><p>Create independent accounts and choose their permissions.</p></div><button id="refresh" class="secondary">Refresh users</button></div><div class="card"><h3>Create user</h3><form id="create-user"><div class="inline-form"><label>Username<input name="username" autocomplete="off" maxlength="80" required></label><label>Temporary password<input name="temporary_password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" required></label><label>Account role<select name="role"><option value="user">User</option><option value="admin">Admin</option></select></label><label>Managed by<select name="parent_admin"><option value="">Superadmin directly</option></select></label><label>Maximum users<input name="max_users" type="number" min="0" max="10000" value="5"></label><label>User allowance ceiling (MiB)<input name="user_quota_mib" type="number" min="1" value="250"></label><label class="check"><input name="manage_users" type="checkbox" checked>Can manage own users</label><label>Storage allowance (MiB)<input name="quota_mib" type="number" min="1" step="1" required></label></div><p class="muted">Admin default: 1 GB, five users. User default: 250 MB. Storage limits are enforced. Give the temporary password to the user through your usual private channel.</p><fieldset><legend>Permissions</legend><div id="new-permissions" class="permissions"></div></fieldset><button type="submit">Create independent user</button></form></div><div class="card"><h3>Existing accounts</h3><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>User</th><th>Status</th><th>Used / allowance</th><th>Access</th></tr></thead><tbody id="users"></tbody></table></div></div><div class="card" id="edit-user" hidden><h3 id="edit-title">Edit user</h3><form id="edit-form"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled">Account enabled</label><label>Storage allowance (MiB)<input type="number" name="quota_mib" min="1" step="1" required></label><label>Managed by<select name="parent_admin"></select></label><label>Maximum users<input name="max_users" type="number" min="0" max="10000"></label><label>User allowance ceiling (MiB)<input name="user_quota_mib" type="number" min="1"></label><label class="check"><input name="manage_users" type="checkbox">Can manage own users</label><fieldset><legend>Permissions</legend><div id="edit-permissions" class="permissions"></div></fieldset><button type="submit">Save access</button></form><form id="reset-form" class="inline-form"><label>New temporary password<input type="password" name="temporary_password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" required></label><button class="secondary" type="submit">Reset password & revoke sessions</button></form></div><div class="card"><div class="heading"><h3>Account audit</h3><button class="secondary" id="audit-refresh">Refresh audit</button></div><p class="muted">Account activity only. Administrator access does not open another user's ledgers.</p><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Action</th><th>Target account ID</th></tr></thead><tbody id="audit"></tbody></table></div></div></section></section><footer>All Crop CN · Independent user workspaces · PC edition</footer></main></body></html>
