+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>All Crop CN · Ledger & Seasons</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/account.css"><script src="/ledger.js" defer></script></head><body><aside class="rail"><div class="brand">◈ <span>All Crop CN<small>PC WEB WORKSPACE</small></span></div><div class="rail-title">Check the source.<br>Choose the season.</div><p>Original voucher dates. Separate season reviews. Your own saved ledgers.</p><div class="phase">PHASE 4 · LEDGER & SEASONS</div><p><a href="/workspace">Projects & workbooks</a></p><p><a href="/">Accounts & sign out</a></p></aside><main><p><a href="/calculator">Open calculator · Classic Emerald / Navy Studio →</a></p><header><span>Ledger & seasons</span><b id="identity">Sign in through Accounts</b></header><div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><section class="card"><h1>Ledger workspace</h1><div class="inline-form"><label>Project<select id="project"></select></label><label>Workbook<select id="workbook"></select></label><button id="reload" type="button">Reload</button></div><p>Create projects/workbooks in <a href="/workspace">My workspace</a>. PDF processing uses this workbook's own catalogue and periods.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>1 · Working periods</h2><div id="period-list"></div><form id="period-form" class="inline-form"><label>Season name<input name="name" placeholder="Rabi 2026–27" required maxlength="100"></label><label>Start<input name="start" type="date" required></label><label>End<input name="end" type="date" required></label><label>Calculation cutoff<input name="cutoff" type="date" required></label><button>Add period</button></form><p>Cutoff allows reviewed late IPT. Receipt dates stay as printed in the statement.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>2 · Products & packing</h2><div id="catalogue-list" class="tablewrap"></div><form id="product-form" class="inline-form"><label>Product<input name="name" placeholder="DAWAT 1 kg" required></label><label>Crop<input name="crop" required></label><label>Segment<input name="segment" required></label><label>Packet weight (kg)<input name="packing_kg" type="number" min="0.000001" step="any" required></label><label>Other printed names (one per line)<textarea name="aliases" rows="2"></textarea></label><button>Add product</button></form><p>Product/packing changes require Edit schemes. Mapping to an existing product requires Edit ledger.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>3 · Import statements</h2><form id="import-form"><label>Single, combined-party or multiple PDFs<input id="pdfs" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" multiple required></label><button id="preview-button">Preview import</button></form><progress id="progress" max="100" value="0" hidden></progress><p id="progress-label"></p><div id="import-preview"></div><label>Reason for replacing a changed statement<input id="replace-reason" maxlength="500"></label><button id="apply-import" type="button" hidden>Apply reviewed import</button><button id="cancel-import" type="button" class="secondary" hidden>Cancel preview</button><p>Preview saves nothing. Applying a batch saves every valid ledger and its source file together. A changed statement needs an explicit replacement choice; earlier history remains saved.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>4 · Parties & ledger review</h2><label>Saved statement<select id="ledger"></select></label><label>Working season<select id="season"></select></label><button id="summary-button" type="button">Check season stock</button><button id="reread-button" type="button" class="secondary">Re-read saved PDF</button><div id="ledger-summary"></div><div id="stock-summary"></div><div id="entries" class="tablewrap"></div></section><section class="card"><h2>5 · Ledger audit</h2><form id="audit-form" class="inline-form"><label>From<input name="start" type="date" required></label><label>To<input name="end" type="date" required></label><button>Run workbook audit</button></form><p>Audit checks active statements across the workbook by posting date. Choose a category to see its findings. Season stock review above uses your explicit season decisions.</p><div id="audit-categories"></div><div id="audit-results"></div><div id="posted-cns"></div></section><section class="card"><h2>6 · April–March Year Link</h2><form id="year-form"><div class="inline-form"><label>Previous full financial year<select id="previous-year"></select></label><label>Current financial year<select id="current-year"></select></label><label>Identity/location review note (if different)<input name="identity_reason" maxlength="500"></label></div><button>Review year link</button></form><div id="year-preview"></div><label>Reconciliation note<input id="year-reason" maxlength="500"></label><button id="year-apply" type="button" hidden>Save confirmed remaining receipt amounts</button><div id="saved-links"></div></section><footer>Review source ledgers and seasons here. Open Calculator for payment allocation, CN calculation, finalisation, issue and reports.</footer></main></body></html>
